# Goal
mrpt_msgs/WaypointSequence waypoints
# If true, the planner never searches for a detour around obstacles found
# while driving: when one blocks the planned path (or the footprint at the
# next waypoint), the robot stops before it and waits until it is gone, or the
# goal is canceled or replaced. Meanwhile, no_progress_timeout does not run
# and no waypoint is skipped (allow_skip is ignored). Needs continuous planning.
bool wait_if_blocked false
---
# Result
mrpt_nav_interfaces/NavigationFinalStatus state
---
# Feedback
mrpt_nav_interfaces/NavigationFeedback state
